{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"**As of 6 November 2026:**\n\n| Issue | Irish ICAV | Irish investment plc |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Per-sub-fund accounts** | May prepare separate financial statements for individual sub-funds, without combined umbrella accounts. | Must prepare financial statements for the umbrella company as a whole; sub-fund disclosures do not replace these. |\n| **Annual general meetings** | Can dispense with AGMs by following the statutory notice procedure. | Generally must hold an AGM; does not benefit from the ICAV’s general opt-out. |\n| **US tax-classification elections** | Eligible for US “check-the-box” elections: potentially partnership treatment with multiple owners or disregarded-entity treatment with one owner. | A *per se* corporation under US tax rules; cannot elect partnership or disregarded-entity status. |\n\n**Worth knowing:** An ICAV is not automatically US-tax-transparent. Eligibility to elect and the classification actually applicable are different questions."}}
